<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκον-ίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put dust to the roots,</i> esp. <i>by digging</i>
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποσκάπτω</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.7.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, of wrestlers, <i>sprinkle oneself with dust,</i> in
			preparation for the contest, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ χεῖρε ὑποκονίεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					401
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.614d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
